g\">Who is a Full-Stack Developer?&nbsp;<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>A Full-Stack Developer is a professional who works on both the front-end (what users see) and the back-end (server, database, and logic) of a website or application. They have the skills to build complete web solutions, from designing user interfaces to handling data and server-side operations. This makes them highly valuable because they can manage the entire development process efficiently. Below are the key areas a full-stack developer works on:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/front-end-development\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Front-End Development<\/a>:<\/strong> Builds the visual part of a website using <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">HTML<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/css\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CSS<\/a>, and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/javascript\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">JavaScript<\/a> to create user-friendly interfaces.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Back-End Development:<\/strong> Handles server logic, APIs, and databases using languages like Node.js, Python, or Java.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Database Management:<\/strong> Works with databases like MySQL or MongoDB to store and manage data.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Version Control:<\/strong> Uses tools like Git to track changes and collaborate with teams.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Deployment &amp; Hosting:<\/strong> Deploys applications on servers or cloud platforms and ensures they run smoothly.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> C