n                                   class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\">\n                                    Learn More\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of Full-Stack Developers<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Full-stack developers are categorized based on the technologies and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-programming-languages\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">programming languages<\/a> they use to build web applications, each offering unique features, tools, and advantages for different project needs. Below are the main types of full-stack developers:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. MERN Stack Developer<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A MERN Stack Developer is a skilled professional who builds complete web applications using MongoDB, Express.js, React, and Node.js. They handle both front-end and back-end development using JavaScript, ensuring smooth communication between client and server. This stack enables faster development, better performance, and easy scalability. It is widely used to create modern, dynamic, and real-time applications.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Technologies Used:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>MongoDB (Database)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Express.js (Backend Framework)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>React.js (Frontend Library)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Node.js (Runtime Environment)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Advantages:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Uses a single language (JavaScript) for full development<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Faster development and deployment<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Highly scalable and performance-driven<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strong ecosystem and community support<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Best For:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Dynamic and interactive web applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Real-time apps (chat apps, dashboards)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Single Page Applications (SPAs)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Startups and scalable projects<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Salary Expectation:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>The <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/mern-stack-developer-salary\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">average salary of a MERN Stack Developer in India<\/a> ranges between <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/mern-stack-developer-salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b94.4 LPA to \u20b94.9 LPA<\/a>, depending on skills, experience, and company.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. MEAN Stack Developer<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A MEAN Stack Developer is a professional who builds complete web applications using MongoDB, Express.js, Angular, and Node.js. They handle both front-end and back-end development using JavaScript, ensuring smooth communication between client and server. This stack is known for creating structured, scalable, and high-performance applications with strong frontend architecture.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Technologies Used:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>MongoDB (Database)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Express.js (Backend Framework)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Angular (Frontend Framework)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Node.js (Runtime Environment)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Advantages:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Uses a single language (JavaScript) across the stack<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strong structure and maintainability with Angular<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Suitable for large and scalable applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Active community and long-term support<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Best For:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Enterprise and large-scale web applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Structured and long-term projects<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Real-time applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Applications requiring strong frontend architecture<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Salary Expectation:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>The average salary of a MEAN Stack Developer in India ranges between <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/mean-stack-developer-salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b96.1 LPA to \u20b96.8 LPA<\/a>, depending on skills, experience, and company.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Java Full-Stack Developer<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A Java Full-Stack Developer is a professional who builds complete web applications by working on both the front-end and back-end. They design user interfaces, manage server-side logic, and handle database operations to ensure smooth performance. This role is widely used for building secure, scalable, and reliable applications, especially in enterprise and large-scale systems.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Technologies Used:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Java (Core Language)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Spring Boot \/ Spring Framework (Backend)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hibernate (ORM Tool)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>HTML, CSS, JavaScript (Frontend)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>MySQL \/ Oracle (Database)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Advantages:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Highly secure and stable architecture<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Suitable for large and complex applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strong ecosystem and long-term support<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Excellent performance and scalability<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Best For:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Enterprise and large-scale applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Banking and financial systems<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Secure and mission-critical applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Long-term and complex projects<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Salary Expectation:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>The average salary of a Java Full-Stack Developer in India ranges between <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/java-full-stack-developer-salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b96.8 LPA to \u20b97.5 LPA<\/a>, depending on skills, experience, and company.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Python Full-Stack Developer<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A Python Full-Stack Developer is a professional who builds complete web applications by working on both the front-end and back-end using Python technologies. They handle user interfaces, server-side logic, and database operations to ensure smooth performance. This role is popular for building scalable, secure, and data-driven applications with clean and readable code.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Technologies Used:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Python (Core Language)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Django \/ Flask (Backend Frameworks)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>HTML, CSS, JavaScript (Frontend)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>PostgreSQL \/ MySQL (Database)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>REST APIs<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Advantages:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Simple and easy-to-learn syntax<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fast development and clean code structure<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strong support for data-driven applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Large community and library support<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Best For:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Web applications and APIs<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Data-driven and AI-based projects<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Startups and rapid development projects<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Scalable backend systems<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Salary Expectation:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>The average salary of a Python Full-Stack Developer in India ranges between <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/fullstack-python-developer-salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b94.8 LPA to \u20b95.4 LPA<\/a>, depending on skills, experience, and company.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. LAMP Stack Developer<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A LAMP Stack Developer is a professional who builds web applications using the LAMP stack, which includes Linux, Apache, MySQL, and PHP. They handle both front-end and back-end development, ensuring websites run smoothly on servers. This stack is widely used for building reliable, cost-effective, and server-side driven web applications.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Technologies Used:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Linux (Operating System)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Apache (Web Server)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>MySQL (Database)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>PHP (Backend Language)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Advantages:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Open-source and cost-effective<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Stable and widely supported stack<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to deploy and manage<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strong community and long-term usage<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Best For:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Traditional and server-rendered websites<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Content management systems (CMS)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Small to medium-scale web applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Budget-friendly projects<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Salary Expectation:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>The average salary of a LAMP Stack Developer in India ranges between <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/lamp-developer-salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b94.8 LPA to \u20b95.3 LPA<\/a>, depending on skills, experience, and company.<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/d